                        <bindingDesc>
                            <p>Lacquer painted (two layers) with a brown leather spine, 19 × 32 cm, front + back cover, lacquer painted leather + pasteboard</p>
                            <decoNote type="border">Both leather doublures feature double-line gilt tooling forming two distinct rectangular frames—an outer border
                                following the edges of the cover and an inner frame enclosing the central field and accented with corner ornaments to function as a decoration.</decoNote>
                            <decoNote></decoNote>
                            <condition>The outer cover's lacquer decoration is severely degraded and heavily abraded, with extensive paint loss, flaking, and abrasion. The board corners exhibit wear and structural damage consistent with age and handling.</condition>
